# data/sources/ holds the official regulation PDFs the answer keys are built
# from (UN GHS, Canada HPR, UK GB CLP, JIS). These are published law and are
# committed for provenance. Real SDS / product documents must NOT go here.

# Real SDS and label PDFs used for validation are COMPANY DATA. Everything in
# this directory stays local: the PDFs themselves and the case, triage and
# spot-check files, which quote product names. Only cases.example.yaml is
# tracked, and it is kept outside this directory.
data/validation/
